# Contributor: Thomas Lange <thomas-lange2@gmx.de>
# Contributor: David Runge <dvzrv@archlinux.org>
# Contributor: Sven-Hendrik Haase <svenstaro@archlinux.org>
# Contributor: Lauri Niskanen <ape@ape3000.com>
